solution:
Let the medians intersect at point $G$ as shown below.  We include the third median of the triangle in red; it passes through the intersection of the other two medians.

[asy]
pair D,EE,F,P,Q,G;

G = (0,0);
D = (-1,0);
P= (0.5,0);
EE = (0,4/3);
Q = (0,-2/3);
